{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Qi Bean is a seed found throughout Stardew Valley and on ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"]," during the quest ",["l","任务#Qi's Crop","Qi's Crop"],". Mature plants yield ",["l","齐瓜","Qi Fruit"],"."]],["p",["All ",["l","齐瓜","Qi Fruit"]," and Qi Beans despawn when the quest is over (i.e., the day after the player ships them or the quest timer ends), including growing crops, all players' inventories, ",["l","宝箱","Chest"],"s, ",["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"],"s, ",["l","小桶","Keg"],"s, and ",["l","马龙","Marlon"],"'s ",["l","探险家公会#Item Recovery Service","Item Recovery Service"]," list. ",["l","农作物#Giant Crops","Giant Qi Fruit"]," will not disappear."]]]],["Locations",2,[["p",["While the quest is active, Qi Beans can be found by:"]],["l",0,[[1,["Breaking rocks - each rock has a 2% chance of dropping a Qi Bean"]],[1,["Shaking ",["l","树","Trees"]," - whenever shaking a tree drops a seed, there is a 50% chance it will also drop a Qi Bean"]],[1,["Chopping ",["l","树","Trees"]," - each tree has a 25% chance of dropping a Qi Bean"]],[1,["Chopping ",["l","大树桩","Large Stump"],"s and ",["l","大圆木","Large Log"],"s - each one has a 25% chance of dropping a Qi Bean"]],[1,["Cutting ",["l","杂草","Weeds"]," - each weed has a 1% chance of dropping a Qi Bean"]],[1,["Checking ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"],"s"]],[1,["Killing ",["l","怪物","Monsters"]," - ",["l","灰尘精灵","Dust Sprite"],"s have a 2% chance of dropping a Qi Bean, all other monsters have a 5% chance"]],[1,["Breaking ",["l","矿物#Geodes","Geodes"],", ",["l","古物宝藏","Artifact Trove"],"s, or ",["l","金色椰子","Golden Coconut"],"s - each one has a 7.5% chance of dropping one Qi Bean, and a 2.5% chance of dropping 5"]],[1,["Digging ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s"]],[1,["Opening Volcano chests"]],[1,["Breaking crates in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],", ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," and ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"]," - each one has a 4% chance of dropping 1-2 Qi beans"]],[1,[["l","钓鱼","Fishing"]]],[1,["Petting a ",["l","动物#Pets","pet cat"]," with max friendship"]]]],["p",["They can also be made by placing a Qi Fruit in a ",["l","种子生产器","Seed Maker"],"."]]]],["Stages",2,[["p",["Qi Fruit can become a ",["l","农作物#Giant Crops","Giant Crop"],"."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Stage 1"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 2"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 3"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 4"]},{"h":1,"v":["Harvest"]}],[[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_3.png",48]],[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_4.png",48]],[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_5.png",48]]],[["1 Day"],["1 Day"],["1 Day"],["1 Day"],["Total: 4 Days"]]]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Dyeing",2,[["p",["The Qi Bean can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a blue dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Tips",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Given that ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"]," have a 43% chance (51% chance for ",["l","钓鱼#Golden Fishing Treasure Chests","Golden Fishing Treasure Chests"],") to yield at least one stack of up to 4 Qi Beans during the quest, fishing is a reliable source of Qi Beans when combined with the ",["l","磁铁","Magnet"]," bait, ",["l","技能#Fishing","Pirate Profession"],", and a ",["l","寻宝者","Treasure Hunter"]," tackle."]],[1,["Putting Qi Fruit into ",["l","种子生产器","Seed Maker"],"s and planting the resulting Qi Beans will, on average, nearly double the Qi Fruit supply. Qi Fruit produced early in the quest can be doubled several times with this method."]],[1,["The use of ",["l","生长激素","Speed-Gro"],", ",["l","高级生长激素","Deluxe Speed-Gro"],", or ",["l","顶级生长激素","Hyper Speed-Gro"],", and the ",["l","技能#Farming","Agriculturist Profession"]," can reduce the time between harvests by 1 or 2 days."]],[1,["Qi Beans can also be amassed quickly using ",["l","宝藏图腾","Treasure Totem"],"s. During the quest, ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s have a 25% chance to drop 2-5 Qi Beans, so each Treasure Totem will produce 14 Qi Beans on average, assuming no obstacle blocks any of the 16 tiles."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5.2","1.5.2"],": Can now be grown on ",["l","农场","the Farm"]," during ",["l","冬季","Winter"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5.3","1.5.3"],": Qi Beans are now properly removed from any machines/craftables and from ",["l","马龙","Marlon"],"'s item recovery service after the ",["l","任务#Qi's Challenge","Qi Challenge"]," expires."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Can now be obtained from ",["l","钓鱼#Golden Treasure Chests","Golden Fishing Treasure Chests"],"."]]]]]]]}